================================================================
A NOTE ON FLASHING
================================================================

The firmware images here have been tested on one instrument. Modified
firmware can leave a device unusable — read your original EPROM twice,
compare the dumps, and keep the chip. Nothing here comes with any
warranty; see the MIT text above.
